id: refusal/bad-usage
name: Clumsy invocation refused honestly
prose: |
  A missing image argument, an extra file argument, an unknown command, and an unknown option are each refused with a nonzero exit and the usage line.
scope:
- src/**
- Cargo.toml
- Cargo.lock
- build
- materials/bordered.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R2
- R3
- R4
rows:
- run: ./brim detect
  expect:
    rc: 2
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg extra.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 2
- run: ./brim scan materials/bordered.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 2
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg --wat
  expect:
    rc: 2
- run: ./brim
  expect:
    rc: 2
